        "documents in scanned PDFs, shared drives and ten-year-old SharePoint sites",
        "a legacy SQL or ERP system with no clean API",
        "a locked-down network, SSO and role-based access rules",
        "a security and compliance team that has to approve every data flow",
        "users who will drop the tool if it is wrong twice"
